 "notes": [
  "Converted from the preset: each pad's sample parts for its note, Key Zone Shift and Sample Selector as stored; velocity zones become layers, a crossfade a switch where a part falls below half its level (a fade at the velocity range's edge keeps playing). gainDb = pad and chain faders + Simpler volume + part volume; Vel as law 'simpler'.",
  "Not reproduced: the instruments' envelopes (every sample plays its region to the end), filters (only their drive), the pads' other devices (none) and the devices around the Drum Rack (none).",
  "Transposed parts, by the preset's transpose or root key, or by a Key Zone Shift, which picks another zone's part and plays it relative to the played note (Live's manual; unverified in Live): 36 Kick 808 Tone8 k.wav -2 st; 38 Snare 808 Tone5 k.wav -1 st; 49 Cymbal 808 Tone5 e.wav -1 st",
  "Over full scale at velocity 127 as the preset sets them (before the drums' strip): 36 +1.4 dBFS, 37 +1.4 dBFS, 38 +1.4 dBFS, 39 +1.4 dBFS, 40 +1.4 dBFS, 41 +1.4 dBFS, 42 +1.4 dBFS, 43 +1.4 dBFS, 44 +1.4 dBFS, 45 +1.4 dBFS, 46 +1.4 dBFS, 47 +1.4 dBFS, 48 +1.4 dBFS, 50 +1.4 dBFS, 51 +1.4 dBFS"
